    "comparisonIndividualCondition": {
      "statement": "Se fija z y se considera un entorno abierto de un punto a_0 > \\underline a. Los retornos R_F,R_I>0, los precios y las remuneraciones efectivas se mantienen fijos y no dependen directamente de los activos en esa comparación.",
      "source_kind": "assumption",
      "source_location": "source-audited.tex:112-114",
      "source_note": "Selected normal-scope semantic prerequisite in the complete source-only inventory; it is not an independent result row.",
      "claim_bearing": false,
      "lean_declarations": ["Barraza26LaborComposition.comparisonIndividualCondition"]
    },
    "laborPreferencesCondition": {
      "statement": "Para s\\in\\{F,I\\}, \\psi_s>0 y \\phi_s>0. El costo de horas es el de \\eqref{eq:preferences}, separable entre actividades.",
      "source_kind": "assumption",
      "source_location": "source-audited.tex:115-117",
      "source_note": "Selected normal-scope semantic prerequisite in the complete source-only inventory; it is not an independent result row.",
      "claim_bearing": false,
      "lean_declarations": ["Barraza26LaborComposition.laborPreferencesCondition"]
    },
    "interiorRegularBranchCondition": {
      "statement": "La función a\\mapsto\\Va(a,z) es positiva y diferenciable en a_0. Las horas de la rama considerada satisfacen las FOC de \\eqref{eq:hoursblock}, son positivas y su suma es estrictamente menor que \\bar H.",
      "source_kind": "assumption",
      "source_location": "source-audited.tex:118-120",
      "source_note": "Selected normal-scope semantic prerequisite in the complete source-only inventory; it is not an independent result row.",
      "claim_bearing": false,
      "lean_declarations": ["Barraza26LaborComposition.interiorRegularBranchCondition"]
    },
    "localConcavityCondition": {
      "statement": "Cuando se interpreta el signo por riqueza se mantiene \\Vaa(a_0,z)<0.",
      "source_kind": "assumption",
      "source_location": "source-audited.tex:121-123",
      "source_note": "Selected normal-scope semantic prerequisite in the complete source-only inventory; it is not an independent result row.",
      "claim_bearing": false,
      "lean_declarations": ["Barraza26LaborComposition.localConcavityCondition"]
    },
    "informalHoursShare": {
      "statement": "Defina la fracción de horas informales como \\sI=\\ell_I/(\\ell_F+\\ell_I). Esta definición cuenta horas y no clasifica ex ante a una persona como informal. Bajo los retornos positivos y la rama interior, 0<\\sI<1.",
      "source_kind": "definition",
      "source_location": "papers/Barraza26LaborComposition/source-audited.tex:128-129",
      "source_note": "Governing unnumbered prose definition selected as a normal-scope semantic prerequisite.",
      "claim_bearing": true,
      "lean_declarations": ["Barraza26LaborComposition.informalHoursShare"]
    },
    "compositionConditionalHours": {
      "statement": "Bajo los supuestos \\ref{ass:fixed}--\\ref{ass:regular}, la política interior satisface \\frac{\\partial\\sI(a_0,z)}{\\partial a}=\\sI(a_0,z)\\bigl(1-\\sI(a_0,z)\\bigr)(\\phi_I-\\phi_F)\\frac{\\Vaa(a_0,z)}{\\Va(a_0,z)}. Si además se cumple el supuesto \\ref{ass:concavity}, la derivada es negativa cuando \\phi_I>\\phi_F, cero cuando \\phi_I=\\phi_F y positiva cuando \\phi_I<\\phi_F.",
      "source_kind": "proposition",
      "source_location": "source-audited.tex:131-139",
      "source_note": "Sole independent named result selected by the complete source-only inventory.",
      "claim_bearing": true,
      "lean_declarations": ["Barraza26LaborComposition.compositionConditionalHoursSpec"]
    }
